---
layout: base.njk
title: Behold my collection of *most* unfinished games
description: A tribute to the pile of digital distractions I’ve almost completed. Games I loved, games I rage quit, and the ones I keep redownloading out of nostalgia or masochism. Achievement unlocked selective commitment.
permalink: /games-that-i-may-or-may-not-play/
---

<h1>{{ title }}</h1>

{% for moodGroup in gameLog.moods %}
  {% set games = collections.games | gameLogByMood(moodGroup.value) %}
  {% if games.length %}
    <section aria-labelledby="mood-{{ moodGroup.value }}" class="my-12">
      <h2 id="mood-{{ moodGroup.value }}">{{ moodGroup.label }}</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-10">
        {% for game in games %}
          <li>
            <article>
              <h3>{{ game.data.title }}</h3>
              <p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent/70">{{ game.data.platform }}</p>
              <div>{{ game.templateContent | safe }}</div>
            </article>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
